{
  "$schema_version": "1.0",
  "kind": "archetypes",
  "note": "Guidance only (Leon, 5 Nov 2026). Archetypes are picked on the creation Cores screen as a preset that pre-fills the 10 skill points; the Skills step can change anything. Nothing about an archetype persists after that screen: no stats, no portrait, no label on the sheet, no change on level-up. Names are generic role words, never class names.",
  "rules": {
    "preset_points": 10,
    "max_per_skill": 5,
    "custom_option": true,
